  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Psionic</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to force a violent evolution within their biology. Thorny vines and calcified roots erupt through their skin, wrapping around their limbs. The target takes <strong>1d8+1</strong> kinetic damage and becomes temporarily <em>Restrained</em>. While <em>Restrained</em> in this way, they take <strong>1d6</strong> kinetic damage if they are still <em>Restrained</em> at the end of their action, as the growth tightens and tears at their body.</p>",
